Origin

gllImage is derived from GDBImage, an enhanced TDBImage component by
Sebastián Mayorá (Argentina, 2000-2025), released as freeware ("use at your
own risk"), as later developed by Roy Lambert (EDBImage). Their work is
acknowledged here and in the source. Roy Lambert has agreed to his part of the
work being distributed under the terms above; Sebastián Mayorá's agreement has
been requested (2026-10-19), and until it is given the freeware terms of his
original code remain his. The changes and additions made in gllImage are
licensed under the terms above.

Contributors to the original: Liliana Troncoso (ShrinkToFit / ZoomToFit),
Shraga Milon (WMClear / WMUndo), Mike Lischke (GraphicEx).
